OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy morning in the east
OL,6,Fwith showers, these mainly over Angus
OL,7,Fand eastern Tayside, before turning
OL,8,Fdrier in the afternoon. Further west,
OL,9,Fit will stay dry with brighter spells.
OL,10,FBecoming breezier near the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and cloudy start to the
OL,13,Fevening but heavy rain and hill snow
OL,14,Fsoon spreading eastwards and
OL,15,Fcontinuing overnight. Strong winds
OL,16,Fpossible on windward coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
