OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain clearing to the east for
OL,6,Fmany through the morning but slower to
OL,7,Fclear on the east coast, lingering
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon. Further west
OL,9,Fturning drier with bright spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy,
OL,12,Fwith some light rain or drizzle
OL,13,Fpossible on Saturday. Breezy with
OL,14,Fbright spells and showers on Sunday.
OL,15,FRain and strong winds arriving from
OL,16,Fthe west on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
